    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skip Lake is a minimalist and relaxing puzzle, set in a lake of crystal clear waters and musical rocks.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/774a0c12dcc206704f3ced6135a05119.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/774a0c12dcc206704f3ced6135a05119.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/774a0c12dcc206704f3ced6135a05119.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game captures the international game of skipping stones into the water, transforming it into a puzzle of logic and direction, with harmony of music and sound effects, carefully composed to relax.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hit the pots trough stunning landscapes</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/1e6cae1e185a4a9ed752d3eb1933cc2e.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/1e6cae1e185a4a9ed752d3eb1933cc2e.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/1e6cae1e185a4a9ed752d3eb1933cc2e.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/512c698e8019282dbbfc177277e9e147.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/512c698e8019282dbbfc177277e9e147.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/512c698e8019282dbbfc177277e9e147.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/b1bf688459ec25ba414fb03b406e35d9.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/b1bf688459ec25ba414fb03b406e35d9.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/b1bf688459ec25ba414fb03b406e35d9.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/fa9ef0f35a169f537187814159f2ec51.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/fa9ef0f35a169f537187814159f2ec51.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/fa9ef0f35a169f537187814159f2ec51.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Touch the rotating pillars until they are at the right angle for the stone to hit until it reaches the pot on the other side of the lake !!<br><br></li><li>Contemplate minimalist art, with details that will delight your eyes.<br><br></li><li>Listen to the Harmony of music and sound effects, Composed carefully just to relax you.<br><br></li><li>Feel the tranquility of a rocky lake with crystal blue water.<br><br></li><li>Solve over 100 intriguing puzzles!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skip Lake is a minimalist and relaxing puzzle, set in a lake of crystal clear waters and musical rocks.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/774a0c12dcc206704f3ced6135a05119.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/774a0c12dcc206704f3ced6135a05119.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/774a0c12dcc206704f3ced6135a05119.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game captures the international game of skipping stones into the water, transforming it into a puzzle of logic and direction, with harmony of music and sound effects, carefully composed to relax.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hit the pots trough stunning landscapes</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/1e6cae1e185a4a9ed752d3eb1933cc2e.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/1e6cae1e185a4a9ed752d3eb1933cc2e.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/1e6cae1e185a4a9ed752d3eb1933cc2e.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/512c698e8019282dbbfc177277e9e147.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/512c698e8019282dbbfc177277e9e147.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/512c698e8019282dbbfc177277e9e147.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/b1bf688459ec25ba414fb03b406e35d9.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/b1bf688459ec25ba414fb03b406e35d9.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/b1bf688459ec25ba414fb03b406e35d9.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/fa9ef0f35a169f537187814159f2ec51.poster.avif?t=1738331139\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/fa9ef0f35a169f537187814159f2ec51.webm?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570160/extras/fa9ef0f35a169f537187814159f2ec51.mp4?t=1738331139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Touch the rotating pillars until they are at the right angle for the stone to hit until it reaches the pot on the other side of the lake !!<br><br></li><li>Contemplate minimalist art, with details that will delight your eyes.<br><br></li><li>Listen to the Harmony of music and sound effects, Composed carefully just to relax you.<br><br></li><li>Feel the tranquility of a rocky lake with crystal blue water.<br><br></li><li>Solve over 100 intriguing puzzles!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u201cSolve beautiful puzzles and listen to the melody of crashing Pots!\u201d",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cDelicious and well built indie game! Peaceful, calm and also intriguing Skip Lake is a piece of art, definately one of RSoft's greatest works.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201cThat the game to have in your game library to relax, with a beautiful setting and a very fluid game, you can lose yourself in time.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br><br>\u201cThe game itself has very pleasant and soothing sounds. This game is totally worth the money.\u201d<br>Steam Reviewer<br>",
